      "text": "In the meantime, the order dated 11.04.2023 passed in Complaint Case No. 1738 of 2022 by the learned J.M, 1st Class, Vaishali at Hajipur whereby cognizance of offences under Sections 323 and 498A of the IPC has been taken, shall remain stayed, as it has been submitted that husband of O.P.\nNo. 2 is not the petitioner in this case and the petitioners are related to the husband of the O.P. No.\n2 and as such they have been implicated in a mechanical manner with general and omnibus allegation.\n(Satyavrat Verma, J) Rishabh/-\nU T Fatima Begum vs The State Of Bihar on 19 October, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/166786035/\n2",
